# User Profile API Tests
# Use with REST Client extension in VSCode

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@token = your_access_token_here

### 1. Get User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Update User Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "phone": "+1234567890"
}

### 3. Update Profile - Partial Update (First Name Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane"
}

### 4. Update Profile - Invalid Phone (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "invalid-phone"
}

### 5. Change Password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "OldPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 6. Change Password - Wrong Current Password (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "WrongPassword",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword123!"
}

### 7. Change Password - Weak New Password (Should Fail)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "OldPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "weak"
}

### 8. Get User Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Delete Account (Deactivate)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "YourPassword123!"
}

### 10. Get Profile Without Token (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
